ng></strong></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 230px\">\n<td style=\"width: 50.8525%;height: 195px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<strong> 27/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong> 19/06/2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong> 20/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>22-23 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>NTA CSIR Exam Date : <strong>17-18 July 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>08/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>13/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available :<strong> 16/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Final Answer Key Available : <strong>29/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Result Declared : <strong>29/08/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 92.6095%;height: 195px\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"313\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General : <strong>1150/-</strong></li>\n<li>EWS / OBC : <strong>600/-</strong></li>\n<li>ST / SC / PH : <strong>325/-</strong></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 108px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 108px\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CSIR UGC NET June 2026 Exam :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years for JRF Only.</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : No Limit for Lectureship (LS) / Assistant Professor.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 36px\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Exam June 2026 Details</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.375%;height: 48px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"155\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Exam Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 48px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>CSIR UGC NET Subject Available</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 84.3079%;height: 48px\" valign=\"top\" width=\"263\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.375%;height: 264px\" rowspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"155\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Examination June 2026 </b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 48px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Chemical Science</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 84.3079%;height: 264px\" rowspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"263\">\n<ul>\n<li>M.Sc / Equivalent Degree with 55% Marks for General / OBC Candidates.</li>\n<li>For SC / ST and PH&nbsp; Candidates : 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>Integrated Course and B.E/ B.Tech / B.Pharma and MBBS Candidates Are Also Eligible for CSIR NET 2024.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 72px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Earth, Atmospheric, Ocean and Planetary Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 48px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Life Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 48px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Mathematical Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.779%;height: 48px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Physical Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 374px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 114px\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>How to Fill NTA CSIR UGC NET June 2026 Online Form</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>National Testing Agency NTA Are Conducted the CSIR UGC NET June 2026&nbsp; Examination and Released the&nbsp; Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the Latest CSIR NET Exam Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>27/05/2026 to 19/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the NTA CSIR UGC NET Examination June 2026 Session Application Form in Sarkari Result Latest Job Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n<p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full CSIR NET June 2026 Notification Before Apply Online Form.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 36px\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 48.8388%;height: 36px\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94.6231%;height: 36px\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 143.462%;height: 36px\" colspan=\"5